  "narrative":{
    "northStar":"The NRW War Room",
    "overview":"A quiet tactical workspace puts the player's heroes, troop stock and model evidence within reach. Neutral charcoal surfaces, parchment text and restrained NRW gold retain the existing gaming identity without competing with the catalog portraits.\n\nNunito keeps dense controls approachable. Flat framed panels separate editing, recommendations and results; evidence expands in place so the player can inspect a recommendation while keeping the surrounding roster visible. This document describes the scoped Bear interface implemented by the V3 shell and its war room overrides.",
    "keyCharacteristics":["Neutral charcoal surfaces with gold for action and selection.","Compact, legible controls and existing Nunito typography.","Flat framed panels and real catalog portraits.","Read-only evidence beside each recommendation."],
    "rules":[
      {"name":"The Gold Has a Job Rule","body":"Use gold for a meaningful action, selected state or model result; keep surrounding surfaces neutral.","section":"colors"},
      {"name":"The Flat Working Surface Rule","body":"Keep ordinary editing and recommendation surfaces flat; reserve overlay depth for dialogs.","section":"elevation"}
    ],
    "dos":["Do use gold for actions, selection and meaningful model results.","Do preserve the existing Nunito family, catalog portraits and original media.","Do keep recommendations and actions above the editable roster on mobile.","Do preserve native disclosure and visible keyboard focus.","Do distinguish stored values, assumptions and unresolved model effects in all four locales.","Do show ready results without waiting for video playback."],
    "donts":["Don't add decorative shadows to ordinary working panels.","Don't invent hero imagery, asset provenance or confirmed game damage claims.","Don't mutate profile values or recalculate rankings merely to open evidence.","Don't add separate skill-level inputs to this workflow.","Don't require animation to understand or access a result."]
  }
}
